<title>USA: Aon Corp Q1 net loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Aon Corp Q1 net loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr	  loss	  $0.02   profit	 $0.69</p>
<p> Net	  loss	  2,700   profit     113,800</p>
<p> Revs		   1,354,300		  942,100</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 169,200		  164,600</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 1997 net includes special charges of $0.54 a share, mainly due to restructuring, and realized investment gains of $0.01 a share. Q1 1996 net includes $0.13 a share income from discontinued operations. Excluding these items, operating income was $0.51 a share in Q1 1997 versus $0.56 a share in Q1 1996.</p>
<p>NOTE: Per share information reflects a three-for-two stock split.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
